{"id":"vod_sn_38646","vodId":"38646","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔女的考验","name_cn":"魔女的考验","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/bec1f6bb80018f9aed429fe2d27137cf.jpg"},"summary":"巧克莉（松本真理香 配音）和香草（井端珠里 配音）是生活在魔界的两个活泼可爱的小魔女，她们其中的一人，将会成为下一任魔界女王，为此，两人之间展开了激烈的竞争。两个姑娘来到了人界，她们的任务是收集由人类心情凝结而成的结晶，数量更多着便能够赢得比赛获得女王的头衔。　　巧克莉个性开朗热情，将对付人类看成是小菜一碟，谁知道人界和魔界大相径庭，反倒是有些内向害羞的香草更受欢迎。某日，巧克莉邂逅了名为皮耶尔（小西大树 配音）的少年，从来不知真爱为何的巧克莉坠入了情网，这也就意味着她即将失去她的魔女之心。不仅如此，邪恶的欧葛尔人企图统治人魔两界，它们将打击的目标首先放在了巧克莉和香草的身上。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/u2Wc74SR9h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/8WgY9XjjxD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/yaR6cFHSdU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/1Xr6JKuMTP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/1LWXzAN8HD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Debbf2wGpt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/bks6Pr3q7R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/10EuiMWnff1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/cWR9BVVSF41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/UGqM00GgCn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/0hMuRdJREU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/f5BCLqSrwD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Cb5x0z9Len1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/451fw4zm9r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":